<span id="S4.T1.15.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:469.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.15.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.15.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">(b) Map Coverage of different exploration policies in minecraft.</span></span>
